      "cover": "https://vigigee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1-c123lair2-scaled.jpg",
      "overview": "Clair is more than bottled water. It is naturally alkaline spring water sourced from pristine Canadian springs, created for people who appreciate purity without compromise. The brand needed to feel as refined as the product itself, communicating freshness, trust, and premium quality at first glance. Our goal was to create an identity that makes every bottle feel as clean and refreshing as the water inside.",
      "whatWeDid": "We built a brand centered around clarity, purity, and understated confidence. From the logo and packaging to the visual language, every element was designed to feel crisp, modern, and effortlessly premium. Soft tones, refined typography, and clean compositions reinforce the product's natural origin while allowing the water itself to remain the hero. The result is a brand that stands out on the shelf through simplicity, giving Clair a distinctive presence that feels timeless, trustworthy, and refreshingly pure.",
