      "cover": "https://vigigee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/MSG-scaled.jpg",
      "overview": "Sruly Singer creates electric, immersive moments that turn weddings into experiences people remember long after the night is over. At the core of his work is electricity. The kind you feel in the room when the music connects, when the crowd responds, and when every moment carries energy and joy. That electricity was always there. It simply needed a clear brand to bring it into focus. The goal was not to change who Sruly is, but to make that electricity visible and unmistakable.",
      "whatWeDid": "We built a brand that feels alive and charged with electricity. The logo is driven by movement, with letterforms inspired by sound waves and rhythm, capturing the feeling of electricity in motion. Every element was designed to feel vibrant without being loud, expressive without being overdone. The result is a brand that feels natural, memorable, and true, positioning Sruly as a go to musician for high energy weddings, with a visual language that finally matches the electricity he creates.",
